# Azure Honeypot + Microsoft Sentinel SIEM Lab

## 📌 Overview
This project demonstrates a full end-to-end cloud SOC setup using:
- Microsoft Azure
- Windows 10 VM Honeypot
- Log Analytics Workspace (LAW)
- Azure Monitor Agent (AMA)
- Microsoft Sentinel SIEM
- Kusto Query Language (KQL)
- Geo-IP enrichment via Sentinel Watchlists
- Custom Attack Map Workbook

## 📁 Architecture Diagram
VM → AMA → Log Analytics Workspace → Sentinel → Workbook

## 🧩 Part 1: Azure VM Honeypot
- Created Windows 10 VM
- Allowed all inbound traffic
- Disabled Windows Firewall
- Generated failed login events (Event ID 4625)

## 🧩 Part 2: Log Analytics workspace
- Created LAW
- Connected the VM
- Verified logs using KQL

